# ITF / reg_exe flow (1-port 1G VDS)

DUT: `src/hw/a5e065bb32aes1_mdk_1x1G` (Quartus 26.1 **VDS**).

The ITF stage named `qsys` in `flow.txt` runs **`prepare_vds_dut.sh`**, which
stages HW and calls `verification/scripts/generate_dut.sh` (VDS validate/generate
→ `ip-make-simscript`).

Compile defines: `+define+TSN_CFG3` and `+define+1G_SPEED`.
Sim scripts land under `itf_vds_work/dut_sim/synopsys/vcsmx/`.
Supplemental RTL: `verification/flist/dut.f`.

Parallel local flow (no `reg_exe`): `src/sim/verification/` Makefile.

## Before running

```bash
export REG_LOCAL_ROOT_DIR_PATH=/path/to/src/sim
```

Recommended ARC-style resources (adjust versions to site policy):

```text
acdskit-rtl/26.1,vcs,vcs-vcsmx-lic,synopsys_vip_common/vip_R-2021.03B,
synopsys_vip_ethernet-lic,synopsys-vip-lic,altuvm/0.9p8,
itf/26.3,regutils/26.3,testutils/26.3,perl/5.8.8
```

`perl/5.8.8` is required for `Env::Path` used by `reg_exe`.

Also need Quartus 26.1 on PATH (`quartus_sh`, `ip-make-simscript`) and `xvfb-run` for VDS generate.

## TSN regression ITF options

```text
--makefile_cfgs=config-3 or --makefile_cfgs=tsn-concurrent
--fixed_seed=1 or --fixed_seed=0
--num_seeds=20
--seed=7
--cov_en=1
--farm or --localr
--regr_list=regression_list.txt
--testname=eth_gdr_base_test
--sequence=tsn_mphy_rst_seq
--perf_en=1
--xprop=1
--dump_on=1
--fdsb_on=1
--error_count=20000
```

### Regression list format

```text
testname=<testname> --sequence=<sequence> [options...]
```

Example:

```text
testname=eth_gdr_base_test --sequence=tsn_sanity_sequence --fixed_seed=0 --num_seeds=20
```

### Coverage

1. Run `./get_cov.sh`
2. `dve -cov -full64 -dir gbx_cov_merged.vdb -elfile <exclusion.el>`

## Examples

Sanity (local):

```bash
cd scripts/itf
reg_exe --localr --testname=eth_gdr_base_test --sequence=tsn_sanity_sequence \
  --seed=7 --uvm_verbosity=UVM_MEDIUM 2>&1 | tee run.txt
```

Farm regression:

```bash
reg_exe --farm --priority=50 --regr_list=regression_list.txt
```

Farm with coverage:

```bash
reg_exe --farm --priority=50 --regr_list=regression_list.txt --cov_en=1 \
  --return-file-mode=all --job-clean-mode=no_clean
```
